  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In meter bridge experiment for measuring unknown resistance &#39;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math>&#39;, the null point is obtained at a distance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> from the left side as shown at point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k&#937;</mi></math>, then the value of unknown resistance &#39;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math>&#39; will be _____&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/01a26563-b9b7-4065-a3e0-60a885a51f56-image.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 189px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2400",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Using balanced wheatstone condition in meter bridge</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>70</mn><mn>30</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Given here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k&#937;</mi></math>.</p><p>The,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>S</mi><mn>30</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>70</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2400</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
